<programme start="20261114210000 +0000" stop="20261114213000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">I&apos;ve Been Killing Slimes for 300 Years and Maxed Out My Level</title><sub-title lang="en">I Maxed Out My Level</sub-title><desc lang="en">Aizawa Azusa accidentally works herself to death at 27 years old; she is reincarnated as an immortal witch and finds the experience of killing slimes for 300 years makes her the strongest adventurer in the world which results in daily challenges.</desc><credits><director>Nobukage Kimura</director><actor>Skyler Davenport</actor><actor>Lizzie Freeman</actor><actor>Rachelle Heger</actor></credits><date>20210410</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.0.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E01</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1280x720/33cc0af0260aff39b6f135094a22f8c7.jpeg"/></programme>
