<programme start="20261114220000 +0000" stop="20261114223000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">I&apos;ve Been Killing Slimes for 300 Years and Maxed Out My Level</title><sub-title lang="en">Along Came an Elf</sub-title><desc lang="en">Just as peace is beginning to reign in Azusa&apos;s home, a young elf named Halkara shows up pleading for her help.</desc><credits><director>Nobukage Kimura</director><actor>Skyler Davenport</actor><actor>Lizzie Freeman</actor><actor>Rachelle Heger</actor></credits><date>20210424</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.2.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E03</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1280x720/33cc0af0260aff39b6f135094a22f8c7.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261114223000 +0000" stop="20261114230000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">I&apos;ve Been Killing Slimes for 300 Years and Maxed Out My Level</title><sub-title lang="en">We Went to a Dragon&apos;s Wedding</sub-title><desc lang="en">Leila is getting married; Azusa and her friends set off to visit Mount Rokko, the home of the Red Dragons.</desc><credits><director>Nobukage Kimura</director><actor>Skyler Davenport</actor><actor>Lizzie Freeman</actor><actor>Rachelle Heger</actor></credits><date>20210501</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.3.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E04</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1280x720/33cc0af0260aff39b6f135094a22f8c7.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261114230000 +0000" stop="20261114233000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">I&apos;ve Been Killing Slimes for 300 Years and Maxed Out My Level</title><sub-title lang="en">A Ghost Appeared</sub-title><desc lang="en">Halkara has built a new Nutri-Spirit factory in a nearby town and is now regularly going there from the cottage in the highlands, but she comes home exhausted every evening.</desc><credits><director>Nobukage Kimura</director><actor>Skyler Davenport</actor><actor>Lizzie Freeman</actor><actor>Rachelle Heger</actor></credits><date>20210508</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.4.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E05</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1280x720/33cc0af0260aff39b6f135094a22f8c7.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261114233000 +0000" stop="20261115000000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">I&apos;ve Been Killing Slimes for 300 Years and Maxed Out My Level</title><sub-title lang="en">Along Came a Leviathan</sub-title><desc lang="en">Azusa receives an invitation from Beelzebub to attend a ceremony in the land of the demons; it seems she earned a favorable reputation with the demons after stopping the conflict between the two Dragon clans in Laika&apos;s homeland.</desc><credits><director>Nobukage Kimura</director><actor>Skyler Davenport</actor><actor>Lizzie Freeman</actor><actor>Rachelle Heger</actor></credits><date>20210515</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.5.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E06</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1280x720/33cc0af0260aff39b6f135094a22f8c7.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261115000000 +0000" stop="20261115003000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">I&apos;ve Been Killing Slimes for 300 Years and Maxed Out My Level</title><sub-title lang="en">We Beat Up a Demon King</sub-title><desc lang="en">Halkara&apos;s knack for inadvertently causing trouble led her to knock out the Demon King Pecora, and now she&apos;s locked in a dungeon.</desc><credits><director>Nobukage Kimura</director><actor>Skyler Davenport</actor><actor>Lizzie Freeman</actor><actor>Rachelle Heger</actor></credits><date>20210522</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.6.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E07</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1280x720/33cc0af0260aff39b6f135094a22f8c7.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261115003000 +0000" stop="20261115010000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">I&apos;ve Been Killing Slimes for 300 Years and Maxed Out My Level</title><sub-title lang="en">A Fake Witch of the Highlands Appeared</sub-title><desc lang="en">As Laika and Flatorte bicker with hungry bellies, Natalie from the guild arrives and tells them about a quest to get rid of a massive number of long hammer boars.</desc><credits><director>Nobukage Kimura</director><actor>Skyler Davenport</actor><actor>Lizzie Freeman</actor><actor>Rachelle Heger</actor><actor>Cristina Valenzuela</actor></credits><date>20240117</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.7.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E08</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1280x720/33cc0af0260aff39b6f135094a22f8c7.jpeg"/></programme>
