<programme start="20261112180000 +0000" stop="20261112190000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">Combat Ships</title><sub-title lang="en">D-Day</sub-title><desc lang="en">A chronological look at the events of the 1944 D-Day landings, and the vessels that made the invasion possible, with an insight into personal stories and engineering wonders.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><category lang="en">History</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p13658854_b_v12_ai.jpg"/></programme>
