<programme start="20261114030000 +0000" stop="20261114060000 +0000" channel="TNT US"><title lang="en">The Flash</title><desc lang="en">Worlds collide when the Flash travels back in time to change the events of the past. However, when his attempt to save his family alters the future, he becomes trapped in a reality in which General Zod has returned, threatening annihilation.</desc><credits><actor>Ezra Miller</actor><actor>Sasha Calle</actor><actor>Michael Shannon</actor></credits><date>20230101</date><category lang="en">Movies</category><category lang="en">Action</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p12742479_p_v8_am.jpg"/></programme>
